{"title":"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Geometric_Interpretation)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Geometric Interpretation)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Vector)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Vector)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/4/e142a427bc2fb5078cc32d7b2d3fe30a62a33c47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_{}^{}$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/f/4cff4419b4854bcff9c95d37372874b9d7040582.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_n^{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" /> to be the minimum value of the sum\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/9/1e96fb544379cfe35283e8fa9f7d5367624e4676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^n \\sqrt{(2k-1)^2+a_k^2},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"162\" height=\"48\" />\nwhere <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/a/20aff604022c59244a9341504a063f145b29746b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_n^{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"12\" /> are positive real numbers whose sum is 17. There is a unique positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/c/a2cd1c2adc0a5a8775c1a15378c3a8ef825966ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^{}_{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/f/4cff4419b4854bcff9c95d37372874b9d7040582.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_n^{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" /> is also an integer. Find this <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/c/a2cd1c2adc0a5a8775c1a15378c3a8ef825966ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^{}_{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Geometric_Interpretation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Geometric_Interpretation)\">Solution 1 (Geometric Interpretation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Geometric Interpretation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> right triangles joined at their vertices, with bases <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/7/1b70976eb4ca80d39934c9d9dce6509ac4399208.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" /> and heights <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/4/a041855bab97e53593803a4f2b1a9d441a7d3b48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,3,\\ldots, 2n - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"17\" />. The sum of their hypotenuses is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/4/c74a070eea97d9363f58a257e05e75fc69efa753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" />. The minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/4/c74a070eea97d9363f58a257e05e75fc69efa753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" />, then, is the length of the straight line connecting the bottom vertex of the first right triangle and the top vertex of the last right triangle, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/0/dc0508e085103f86c192f6dcf98a334f927655d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_n \\ge \\sqrt {\\left(\\sum_{k = 1}^n (2k - 1)\\right)^2 + \\left(\\sum_{k = 1}^n a_k\\right)^2}.\\]\" width=\"296\" height=\"64\" />\nSince the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> odd integers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/6006bba637eef443381fbaff768fa62d9ff41e62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> and the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/7/1b70976eb4ca80d39934c9d9dce6509ac4399208.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" /> is 17, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/2/db280024d88e7e9e694ba3f6403019a7943178d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_n \\ge \\sqrt {17^2 + n^4}.\\]\" width=\"129\" height=\"19\" />\nIf this is an integer, we can write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/0/ac061f57833515ff164e26e0254a2018be344160.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17^2 + n^4 = m^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" />, for an integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/1/2716afd37e08153a7b396fc70e28dca87733e36b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m - n^2)(m + n^2) = 289\\cdot 1 = 17\\cdot 17 = 1\\cdot 289.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"366\" height=\"19\" /> The only possible value, then, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/0/7d00d6cfbf7dab73af54367e971ffc25a4091499.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$145$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, in which case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/6/b36b8f72d46ad6fa5e230d50e0c1699febeda2a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 = 144$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/e/a6e90c28cc2a11faa7c7f7ccae6a88190c7e9c78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\boxed {012}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"76\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The inequality \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/0/dc0508e085103f86c192f6dcf98a334f927655d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_n \\ge \\sqrt {\\left(\\sum_{k = 1}^n (2k - 1)\\right)^2 + \\left(\\sum_{k = 1}^n a_k\\right)^2}.\\]\" width=\"296\" height=\"64\" />\nis a direct result of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Minkowski_Inequality\" title=\"Minkowski Inequality\">Minkowski Inequality</a>. Continue as above.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/767b7feb2f9d5f687b8776f302253b692ab4a042.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{i} = (2i - 1) \\tan{\\theta_{i}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"145\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/d/3fd77e67d5e894bf1026f4cffd551f2856f52af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le i \\le n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/2/a12750ab0063e35e17582841667c65fa4b3d5077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\le \\theta_{i} &lt; \\frac {\\pi}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"34\" />. We then have that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/3/1730221b1cac8fda89e85adb986c2e50236ac0c5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_{n} = \\sum_{k = 1}^{n}\\sqrt {(2k - 1)^{2} + a_{k}^{2}} = \\sum_{k = 1}^{n}(2k - 1) \\sec{\\theta_{k}}\\]\" width=\"362\" height=\"48\" />\nNote that that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/0112c3ae6b6c34e310829e3822a77dfcf4cb4deb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{n} + 17 = \\sum_{k = 1}^{n}(2k - 1)(\\sec{\\theta_{k}} + \\tan{\\theta_{k}})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"299\" height=\"48\" />.\nNote that for any angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, it is true that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/e/f1ede92902d9cdd330042a11b188691cb4b5d62c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sec{\\theta} + \\tan{\\theta}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"95\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/d/2adfa1c8e468261f92df58c0c31e0b55c4ed8eaf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sec{\\theta} - \\tan{\\theta}$\" width=\"95\" height=\"13\" /> are reciprocals. We thus have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/6/b960e2c6a02e3f883f236cd6f41ced3469af5736.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_{n} - 17 = \\sum_{k = 1}^{n}(2k - 1)(\\sec{\\theta_{k}} - \\tan{\\theta_{k}}) = \\sum_{k = 1}^{n}\\frac {2k - 1}{\\sec{\\theta_{k}} + \\tan{\\theta_{k}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"467\" height=\"48\" />. By the AM-HM inequality on these <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/a/a6a719ab858b04f20ad51958e6fb53a1e8ba477a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> values, we have that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44b116a0a4fd2259afa28e5abc34bce0e566468f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac {S_{n} + 17}{n^{2}}\\ge \\frac {n^{2}}{S_{n} - 17}\\rightarrow S_{n}^{2}\\ge 289 + n^{4}\\]\" width=\"291\" height=\"41\" />\nThis is thus the minimum value, with equality when all the tangents are equal. The only value for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/4/bb4fb986f529151f411047c9d60123a6a0f8b489.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt {289 + n^{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> is an integer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/f/cefb228f8a931fc4130dedbacbe69e4ed30d71b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> (see above solutions for details).\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Vector.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Vector)\">Solution 4 (Vector)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Vector)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Observe the sum and apply it to the Cartesian plane, we can see that it is basically calculating distance between the origin and two points. Therefore we can assume every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/1/7714e8f416dc4a5220f215b5c10c8afe264dc478.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{(2k-1)^2+a_k^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"132\" height=\"35\" /> to be a vector from the origin to point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/373cc5ea19edd0d00cee0cf30df72bd05032b29a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2k-1, a_k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"20\" />. \nNow we can do sum inside the vector so we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/b/10b84c316fe9386546e852178545ef8bf83a6683.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$((1+3+5+\\ldots+2k-1,   a_1+a_2+a_3+\\ldots+a_k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"398\" height=\"20\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/7/50774ee72f1fe9fc00d335536887e2444d2b4d86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1+\\ldots+a_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"15\" /> to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/1/511221bbf524f6f9ae1b7064687717818d2be795.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+3+\\ldots+2k-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"158\" height=\"16\" /> to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/5/0e5c83cc0c639fc2ed843bbe2d3d209fb478b104.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" />. Then we calculate the length of the vector to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad130184820492f26a1b62b758bd5b51f579167b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{k^4+289}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"21\" />. Since the sum needs to be an integer, we assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/9/6e951e532a0f0cff51e8f6160429a03d04011a52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^4+289$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" /> equals to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/2/752ccf51ef0be42644a0099346e876310df962f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" />. Applying difference between squares, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/a/b4a0dc9f79523befebe7658249e7d20350f027b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^2-s=289$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/f/fefa016a196324c576a6111c6178b015f1d0a917.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^2+s=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" />. Therfore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/c/b4c958b1e0308a4872a3d796d465b8a3e37c5803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2k^2$\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/2/4025f261d969b2926db6d4113d44982c791e198e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$288$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/a/68a8d1d5a2b34b0e8d8e3282c3d0b020ef2d1add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=n=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"14\" /> to be the final answer.\n</p>\n<hr /><p>JINZHENQIAN\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME\" title=\"1991 AIME\">1991 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1991 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016231109\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 344/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1738/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 97/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 10032/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.396      1 -total\n 58.86%    7.296      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.39%    4.883      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2892:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016231109 and revision id 281309. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}